    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_f3687e81",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: nesquick_meme; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a chocolate bar splashing into milk on a spoon, with text reading 'when you dont stir the nesquick powder in your milk enough.' This is a humorous, self-deprecating meme that uses an exaggerated visual metaphor to describe the common experience of poorly mixed Nesquik powder. The intent is to evoke relatable humor and mild frustration, not to target or harm any group. The visual is playful and absurd, not abusive, hateful, or propagandistic. The humor stems from the contrast between the realistic milk splash and the unrealistic chocolate bar, which is not a real Nesquik product. There is no toxicity present as it does not involve disparaging any protected group or promoting harm. The meme's purpose is purely comedic and lighthearted, using visual exaggeration to highlight a mundane, everyday mishap.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2eb13754"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
