      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_0c72687c",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "nesquik_powder",
      "label": "Nesquik Powder",
      "description": "A brand of chocolate-flavored powdered drink mix, commonly used to make chocolate milk. The meme references the common experience of not stirring the powder enough, leading to clumps or poor mixing, which is humorously exaggerated by depicting a solid chocolate bar splashing into milk.",
